                        "submissionMethodDetails": "DSIT is using the Jaggaer eSourcing Portal for this procurement.\n**DO NOT apply directly to the buyer. All tender information MUST be submitted through the portal.**\nPlease review all attached information to ensure a full understanding of this requirement. All attachments can be found in the Supplier Attachments tab within the Jaggaer eSourcing Portal.\nTo register on the Jaggaer eSourcing portal please use the link https://beisgroup.ukp.app.jaggaer.com/ and follow the instructions to register as a supplier. If you are already registered on the Jaggaer eSourcing Portal and wish to participate in this procurement, please use the link: https://beisgroup.ukp.app.jaggaer.com/ Once you are logged into the system, you will be able to locate the Procurement you wish to leave a bid on by clicking the ITTs Open to All Suppliers and searching for 'International Charter: Space and Major Disasters - Strategic Support'. The ITT reference number is itt_2878. Alternatively, follow this link to the ITT: \nhttps://beisgroup.ukp.app.jaggaer.com/go/3037257401A1E9316387\nApplications will close at 15:00 GMT on Thursday 7th January 2027. It will not be possible to submit applications beyond this deadline.",
