                                            "name": "Executive Secretariat, Chairmanship and Strategic Delivery",
                                            "description": "Describe your proposed methodology for delivering the Charter Executive Secretariat function on behalf of UKSA throughout the contract period. Your response must explain how you will represent and advance agreed UK positions; provide timely, impartial advice to UKSA; prepare briefings and deliver Charter workplan actions; manage relationships across the Charter, UK Government and the Operational Support Provider; and prepare for and support the UK's anticipated six-month Chairmanship of the Charter in 2029.",
